The three-line key/separator/value append sequence was written out twice in `appendTo(Appendable, Iterator<? extends Entry<?, ?>>)`. Extracted into a private `appendEntry(Appendable, Entry<?, ?>)` method that both call sites now share. The body of the public method shrinks from 12 lines to 6, and the logic reads linearly: "for each entry, append it; between entries, append the separator."

